he gmp ready now again that is for  uh materials that we have  not ever packed before so obviously we  we've got an ever growing  uh library of uh absorbance so  if we already have packed the materials  it would be standardly about seven weeks  uh delivery for a gmp rating column if  it's a new material we go through that  process of  packing developments and then hand over  tt to our gmp facility  okay that's great and do you have any  experience of non-agaris materials  yes we do we've packed uh we've  obviously  our materials are agarose based we have  packed uh  other customers aggros based materials  as well as um  resin materials so we have packed uh  other companies resins as well and uh  with great success okay perfect  um do you also supply  a regulatory support package for the  columns and and what does that sort of  cover what sort of details are in there  yeah so we have uh a generic regulatory  support file for the evolve d columns  and  as i already mentioned that covers the  fact that we've performed  the bioburden testing we've done  pressure testing mechanical testing  we also provide the range of  suitability of materials we have  documentation for leachables and  extractables from the materials that  have been provided for the manufacture  of the columns so  we provide a whole host of documentation  uh  as well as also uh tse statements so a  whole range of of documentation  uh suitable for the the customer to uh  to give them the confidence that they  can go into manufacturing  okay perfect at the moment that's all  the questions we have  then buzz so again thanks very much for  your time  um and thank everyone for joining as  buzz mentioned if you  want to find out any more information or  you have any questions then please don't  hesitate to contact us  as i mentioned we've recorded this  presentation and we'll be providing a  link for it shortly  other than that thank you all for  joining and stay safe  thanks everyone thank you
 

